    onNodeEnd:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - nodeId: 8
    speakerId: 
    initialized: 0
    speakerIsThis: 0
    overWriteValues: 0
    text: you knew who had done this.
    initFromScriptableObject: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    speakerGameObject: {fileID: 0}
    speakerName: 
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    useSpriteAtlas: 0
    spriteAtlas: []
    spriteId: 0
    _speakerVoiceClips: []
    material: {fileID: 0}
    onNodeStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onNodeEnd:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - nodeId: 9
    speakerId: 
    initialized: 0
    speakerIsThis: 0
    overWriteValues: 0
    text: forcing yourself upright with unsteady legs, you rose from the blood-soaked
      floor.
    initFromScriptableObject: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    speakerGameObject: {fileID: 0}
    speakerName: 
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    useSpriteAtlas: 0
    spriteAtlas: []
    spriteId: 0
    _speakerVoiceClips: []
    material: {fileID: 0}
    onNodeStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onNodeEnd:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - nodeId: 10
    speakerId: 
    initialized: 0
    speakerIsThis: 0
    overWriteValues: 0
    text: 'with a scream of pure rage, you tore your own arms apart, wrenching from
      your bones the sharpest spear you knew how to make. '
    initFromScriptableObject: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    speakerGameObject: {fileID: 0}
    speakerName: 
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    useSpriteAtlas: 0
    spriteAtlas: []
    spriteId: 0
    _speakerVoiceClips: []
    material: {fileID: 0}
    onNodeStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onNodeEnd:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - nodeId: 11
    speakerId: 
    initialized: 0
    speakerIsThis: 0
    overWriteValues: 0
    text: "you had already swung it at the chest of drawers when its fleshly soul
      slithered out from between the drawers\u2014a drooling tongue of raw meat that
      coiled around your body, tightening as it tried to strangle you."
    initFromScriptableObject: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    speakerGameObject: {fileID: 0}
    speakerName: 
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    useSpriteAtlas: 0
    spriteAtlas: []
    spriteId: 0
    _speakerVoiceClips: []
    material: {fileID: 0}
    onNodeStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onNodeEnd:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - nodeId: 12
    speakerId: 
    initialized: 0
    speakerIsThis: 0
    overWriteValues: 0
    text: you screamed louder still and ripped at its sinewy, boneless flesh with
      your bare hands, clawing yourself a way out of its body.
    initFromScriptableObject: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    speakerGameObject: {fileID: 0}
    speakerName: 
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    useSpriteAtlas: 0
    spriteAtlas: []
    spriteId: 0
