        m_Calls: []
  - nodeId: 14
    speakerId: 
    initialized: 0
    speakerIsThis: 0
    overWriteValues: 0
    text: even after you broke free, you kept driving the spear into that mass of
      meat, over and over, determined that it would never again be able to speak
      your name.
    initFromScriptableObject: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    speakerGameObject: {fileID: 0}
    speakerName: 
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    useSpriteAtlas: 0
